Description: Advanced Network Settings for palOS
 Every saved Wi-Fi, Ethernet and VPN connection with all its settings:
 addresses and DNS (IPv4 and IPv6), private Wi-Fi addresses, metered
 connections, priority, proxy, Wi-Fi security including enterprise sign-in, and
